<h3>Title Pages (4 pages)</h3>
<p><span class="fill">[FILL IN]</span> Page 1: Project title, student name, roll number, department, university logo, session/year. Page 2: Supervisor name/designation and approval signature block. Page 3: Degree statement (“submitted in partial fulfilment of the requirements for the degree of …”). Page 4: Certificate / undertaking that work is original. Keep branding formal; no technical content.</p>

