<h2>CHAPTER 5 — RESULTS AND DISCUSSION</h2>

<h3>Experimental Setup</h3>
<p>Describe hardware/OS if known <span class="fill">[FILL IN]</span>; Python/TF versions; commands: build_manifest → train --model all → evaluate → leakage_probe; batch size; seed; class counts from manifest printout <span class="fill">[INSERT]</span>.</p>

<h3>Expected Performance Characteristics</h3>
<p>Discuss a priori: 4-class harder than binary; COVID recall weakest; accuracy may drop vs historical single-disease numbers and that drop is informative; balanced accuracy preferred; ensemble may stabilise predictions when models disagree less on Normal/Pneumonia than COVID.</p>

